                "text": "UC resident physicians and fellows unionized with @cirseiu have been barred from bargaining sessions because their crucial work at the front lines of health care makes virtual attendance the only option.\u00a0\n\nI call on the @UofCalifornia to let these doctors advocate and be heard! https://t.co/BQYd46L5dJ",
