                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My heart is with the family and loved ones of our Bay Area social worker who passed just yesterday. \n\nOur health care workers serve on the frontlines and save countless lives every year. We must commit to prevent a tragedy like this from happening on our watch.",
