                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Here's what we delivered during my time as Secretary of Health and Human Services:\n\n1. Record high number of Americans covered by health insurance.\n\n2. 700 million COVID shots in arms to get us out of a deadly pandemic.\n\n3. Lower prescription drug prices for seniors on Medicare. https://t.co/ixOFSEOjyv",
