                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Dr. Rachel Levine served this nation with distinction and honor as our Assistant Secretary of Health at HHS.\n\nInstead of disrespecting public health experts, this administration should heed their counsel and focus on doing its job.\n\nAmericans are tired of the constant culture wars that fan the flames of division.",
